SC,0013
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1795004316
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGrand Theft Auto 6 begins worldwide
OL,4,Arelease after 13-year wait ` and the
OL,5,Aearly reviews are in
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe crime game, where players can
OL,8,Fexplore a fictional US state called
OL,9,FLeonida, features the series' first
OL,10,Fplayable female protagonist in a 3D
OL,11,Fsetting
OL,13,FAnalysts believe the game cost more
OL,14,Fthan $1bn (#866m) to develop - in the
OL,15,FUK, it is priced at #69.99 and in the
OL,16,FUS at $79.99
OL,18,FThe game was delayed twice, from autumn
OL,19,F2025, and then May 2026, before finally
OL,20,Flaunching
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
